  "notes": "A cheerful piano rag. A high, tinkling introduction (0:00–0:13), then the stride left hand drops in (0:13.4) and the main strain bounces along in gold, its loudest bar at P1 (0:29.3); a lighter episode without the oom-pah (0:43.5), the strain's figure returns (motif B, 0:50.1, as at 0:23.5), and a coda in C (1:01.5) runs to the final chord. Small, bright and quick: beads, stars, a pulse on the clear beat; the stride scene returns with its theme.",
